msgid ""
"Mother Base consists of a number of teams, such as\n"
"the Combat Unit, the R&D Team, and the Medical Team."
msgstr ""
"母基地由多个班组成，如\n"
"战斗班、研发班和医疗班。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e31c
