#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000001
msgid ""
"It's been exactly twelve hours since we\n"
"administered the drug."
msgstr ""
"距离我们\n"
"给药已经整整十二个小时了。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000002
msgid "I trust your dreams were pleasant...Big Boss?"
msgstr "想必你做了个好梦……BIG BOSS？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000003
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000045
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x94ec7b/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000064
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000056
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000066
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr "你在说什么？"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000004
msgid "Please, drop the act. I know all about you, Boss."
msgstr "别装了。我对你的事了如指掌，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000005
msgid "Or would you prefer I called you... Naked Snake?"
msgstr "还是说，你更希望我叫你……NAKED SNAKE？"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000006
msgid "Sounds like you've got the right guy."
msgstr "看来你找对人了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000007
#: slot/0x003af9cd/0x327091/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000007
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "你是谁？"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000008
msgid ""
"My name is Lt. Cunningham.\n"
"Until four weeks ago, I was with the CIA."
msgstr ""
"我叫坎宁安中尉。\n"
"四周前，我还在中情局。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x000009
msgid "Cunningham...? FOX Unit's interrogation specialist?"
msgstr "坎宁安……？FOX部队的审讯专家？"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000a
msgid "Ah, so you have heard of me. I'm honored, Snake."
msgstr "哦，你听说过我。荣幸之至，SNAKE。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000b
msgid ""
"And those guys who attacked me --\n"
"they were FOX, too?"
msgstr ""
"那些袭击我的人——\n"
"他们也是FOX的人吗？"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000c
msgid "Yeah... Although, we'll leave it at that, for now."
msgstr "没错……不过，这事暂时就说到这。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000d
msgid "What do you want from me? I'm retired from FOX."
msgstr "你想从我这里得到什么？我已经从FOX退役了。"

#: slot/0x002088cc/0x2ba8a7/0x00000e
msgid ""
